The news passages, scenarios and exception phrases are synthetic: they were
written for this benchmark with the help of a language model and reviewed by
the authors, and are not taken from published news coverage. Short policy excerpts
shown in configurations C3 and C4 are quoted or paraphrased from the
journalism codes of ethics listed in sources.csv, which remain the property of
the organisations that issued them; the codes themselves are not
redistributed here.
